{"version":1,"content":"<p>長城汽車董事長魏建軍今日到訪格力電器，與格力電器董事長董明珠展開交流，期間談及國內汽車產業的發展現狀，直言不少汽車企業依靠國家補貼維持生存。<strong>魏建軍表示，汽車產業是一個非常特殊的行業，各地方都會對其進行保護，寧可讓企業一直運轉，也不願意看到它倒閉。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588066.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.700512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:38:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:35.895469+00:00","content_hash":"75aff4b0c52deb71b70eb34157c34108574d8321fe80bc2615d42cf92c1ba015","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}